    "Tennis" : {
      "comment" : "HKWorkoutActivityType display name",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tennis"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That leaves no muscle groups to train. Try removing an exclusion." : {
      "comment" : "Error message when the user has excluded all muscle groups.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Damit bleiben keine Muskelgruppen zum Trainieren übrig. Entferne eine Ausnahme."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The best place to start. Two alternating full-body sessions built on the basic movement patterns — squat, hinge, press, pull. Run them two or three times a week with a rest day in between." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der beste Einstieg. Zwei abwechselnde Ganzkörper-Einheiten auf Basis der Grundbewegungen — Kniebeuge, Hüftbeugung, Drücken, Ziehen. Zwei- bis dreimal pro Woche mit einem Ruhetag dazwischen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The best place to start. Two alternating full-body sessions built on the basic movement patterns — squat, hinge, press, pull. Run them two or three times a week with a rest day in between."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The classic four-day split: one upper-body session, one lower-body session, each run twice a week. More volume per muscle group than full body, without the schedule a six-day split demands." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der klassische Vier-Tage-Split: eine Oberkörper- und eine Unterkörper-Einheit, jeweils zweimal pro Woche. Mehr Volumen pro Muskelgruppe als beim Ganzkörpertraining, ohne den Zeitaufwand eines Sechs-Tage-Splits."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The classic four-day split: one upper-body session, one lower-body session, each run twice a week. More volume per muscle group than full body, without the schedule a six-day split demands."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The export is a CSV file with every set you logged, for a spreadsheet or another app. Restoring resets the preloaded content to its original state without touching your own workouts. Deleting removes everything you created — your workout history stays." : {
      "comment" : "Settings: data section footer",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Export ist eine CSV-Datei mit jedem erfassten Satz, für eine Tabelle oder eine andere App. Wiederherstellen setzt die vorinstallierten Inhalte in den Originalzustand zurück, ohne deine eigenen Workouts anzutasten. Löschen entfernt alles von dir Erstellte — dein Trainingsverlauf bleibt erhalten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Full Body Blast workout is a total body workout that targets all your major muscle groups. It's perfect for those who want to get a quick and effective workout in." : {
      "comment" : "fullBodyBlastInfo",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Full Body Blast Workout ist ein Ganzkörpertraining, das alle wichtigen Muskelgruppen anspricht. Es ist perfekt für alle, die ein schnelles und effektives Workout absolvieren möchten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Highintesive Intervaltriainig is a Workout-type that doesn't need that much time but everyone gets out of breath. If you do not have much time but want to do something, this is the perfect Workout for you." : {
      "comment" : "HiitInfo",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die hochintensive Intervalltraining ist ein Workout-Typ, der nicht viel Zeit braucht, aber jeden aus der Puste bringt. Wenn du nicht viel Zeit hast, aber etwas tun willst, ist dies das perfekte Workout für dich."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The perfect routine after you burned your muscles to recover properly" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die perfekte Routine, nachdem du deine Muskeln beansprucht hast, um dich richtig zu erholen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The perfect routine after you burned your muscles to recover properly"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The rest timer starts after each set of a strength workout, also on your Lock Screen and Apple Watch. Circuit rest is the default for new cardio and HIIT workouts; each workout can change it on its detail screen." : {
      "comment" : "Settings: workout section footer",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Pausen-Timer startet nach jedem Satz eines Krafttrainings, auch auf dem Sperrbildschirm und der Apple Watch. Die Zirkelpause gilt für neue Cardio- und HIIT-Workouts; jedes Workout kann sie auf seiner Detailseite ändern."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The standard push/pull/legs cycle on barbells and dumbbells. Run it twice a week — six sessions — once you can recover from that." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der klassische Push/Pull/Legs-Zyklus mit Lang- und Kurzhanteln. Zweimal pro Woche — sechs Einheiten — sobald du dich davon erholst."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The standard push/pull/legs cycle on barbells and dumbbells. Run it twice a week — six sessions — once you can recover from that."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Starter Workout is designed specifically for beginners. With a short duration and simple exercises, it's manageable for almost anyone. If it feels too easy, you can immediately move on to a harder workout or repeat it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Starter-Workout ist speziell für Einsteiger konzipiert. Mit kurzer Dauer und einfachen Übungen ist es für fast jeden machbar. Wenn es sich zu leicht anfühlt, kannst du sofort ein schwierigeres Workout anhängen oder es wiederholen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Starter Workout is designed specifically for beginners. With a short duration and simple exercises, it's manageable for almost anyone. If it feels too easy, you can immediately move on to a harder workout or repeat it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The weight you could lift once, estimated from your best working set (Epley)." : {
      "comment" : "Last sessions: what the estimated 1RM is",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Gewicht, das du einmal heben könntest – geschätzt aus deinem besten Arbeitssatz (Epley)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The workout keeps recording on this iPhone." : {
      "comment" : "Active workout: the watch couldn't be reached",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Workout wird weiter auf diesem iPhone aufgezeichnet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There are no workouts." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Es gibt noch keine Workouts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There aren't enough exercises available for the selected splits with your equipment. Add more equipment to your gym profile." : {
      "comment" : "An alert message displayed when there aren't enough exercises available for the selected splits with the user's equipment.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Es sind nicht genug Übungen verfügbar für den ausgewählten Split mit deinem Equipment. Füge Equipment zu deinem Gym-Profil hinzu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This athletic conditioning workout focuses on power, agility, and explosive strength. Great for athletes looking to improve sports performance." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieses athletische Konditionstraining konzentriert sich auf Power, Agilität und explosive Kraft. Ideal für Sportler, die ihre Leistung verbessern möchten."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This athletic conditioning workout focuses on power, agility, and explosive strength. Great for athletes looking to improve sports performance."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This back-focused workout targets all the major muscles in your back for improved posture, strength and definition. A strong back is essential for overall upper body strength." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieses rückenorientierte Workout trainiert alle großen Rückenmuskeln für bessere Haltung, Kraft und Definition. Ein starker Rücken ist essenziell für die gesamte Oberkörperkraft."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This back-focused workout targets all the major muscles in your back for improved posture, strength and definition. A strong back is essential for overall upper body strength."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This balanced fitness plan provides a well-rounded approach to overall health and fitness. It includes a mix of strength, cardio, flexibility, and core work for comprehensive fitness development." : {
      "comment" : "Balanced Fitness infoText",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieser ausgewogene Fitnessplan bietet einen ganzheitlichen Ansatz für Gesundheit und Fitness. Er kombiniert Krafttraining, Ausdauer, Beweglichkeit und Rumpftraining für eine umfassende Fitnessentwicklung."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This bodyweight strength circuit challenges every major muscle group using nothing but your own body weight. It's intense — if you're just getting started, try an easier workout first." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieser Ganzkörper-Kraftzirkel fordert alle wichtigen Muskelgruppen ausschließlich mit dem eigenen Körpergewicht. Er ist intensiv – wer gerade erst anfängt, sollte lieber mit einem leichteren Workout starten."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This bodyweight strength circuit challenges every major muscle group using nothing but your own body weight. It's intense — if you're just getting started, try an easier workout first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This can't be undone." : {
      "comment" : "Exercise delete confirmation: generic warning",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das kann nicht rückgängig gemacht werden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This cardio workout is designed to improve your cardiovascular health and burn calories. It consists of a variety of high-intensity exercises that will get your heart rate up and challenge your endurance." : {
      "comment" : "cardioInfo",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieses Cardio-Workout wurde entwickelt, um deine kardiovaskuläre Gesundheit zu verbessern und Kalorien zu verbrennen. Es besteht aus einer Reihe hochintensiver Übungen, die deine Herzfrequenz in die Höhe treiben und deine Ausdauer fordern."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This comprehensive strength plan focuses on building functional strength across all major muscle groups. Follow this plan to increase your overall strength and muscle development." : {
      "comment" : "Strength Plan infoText",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieser umfassende Krafttrainingsplan konzentriert sich auf den Aufbau funktioneller Kraft in allen wichtigen Muskelgruppen. Folge diesem Plan, um deine gesamte Kraft und Muskelentwicklung zu steigern."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This HIIT-Workout is challenging to anybody!" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieses HIIT-Workout fordert jeden heraus!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This HIIT-Workout is challenging to anybody!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This kettlebell circuit workout combines strength and cardio for an efficient total body workout. The kettlebell is a versatile tool that provides both resistance and momentum challenges." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieses Kettlebell-Zirkeltraining kombiniert Kraft und Cardio für ein effizientes Ganzkörper-Workout. Die Kettlebell ist ein vielseitiges Trainingsgerät, das sowohl Widerstand als auch Schwung fordert."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This kettlebell circuit workout combines strength and cardio for an efficient total body workout. The kettlebell is a versatile tool that provides both resistance and momentum challenges."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This maschine-workout is for those who want to challenge themselves. It is for maschines! Many exercises that challange everyone. If you are not yet fit, you should probably try a simpler workout." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieses Maschinen-Workout ist für alle, die sich herausfordern wollen. Es ist für Maschinen! Viele Übungen, die jeden fordern. Wenn du noch nicht fit bist, solltest du vielleicht ein einfacheres Workout ausprobieren."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This maschine-workout is for those who want to challenge themselves. It is for maschines! Many exercises that challange everyone. If you are not yet fit, you should probably try a simpler workout."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This permanently removes the workout from your history." : {
      "comment" : "Finished workout: delete message",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das entfernt das Workout dauerhaft aus deinem Verlauf."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This permanently removes the workout from your history."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Plan is designed to help you relax and rejuvenate. It is a great way to reduce stress and tension." : {
      "comment" : "Relaxing Plan infoText",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieser Plan hilft dir dabei, zu entspannen und neue Energie zu tanken. Er ist ideal, um Stress und Anspannung abzubauen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Plan is perfect if you want to get into regular working out. With plans, you have a plan designed for your needs and a goal to archieve." : {
      "comment" : "Starter Plan infoText",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieser Plan ist perfekt für dich wenn du mit regelmäßigem Sport anfangen willst. Probiere diesen Plan aus um die vielen Vorteile von Trainingsplänen schätzen zu lernen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
