    "Yoga is a physical, mental, and spiritual practice that originated in ancient India. It involves a series of postures, breathing exercises, and meditation techniques designed to promote relaxation, flexibility, strength, and balance." : {
      "comment" : "yogaInfo",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Yoga ist eine körperliche, geistige und spirituelle Praxis, die ihren Ursprung im alten Indien hat. Sie umfasst eine Reihe von Körperhaltungen, Atemübungen und Meditationstechniken, die Entspannung, Flexibilität, Kraft und Gleichgewicht fördern sollen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yoga Strap" : {
      "comment" : "Yoga Strap",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Yoga-Band"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You changed this workout today" : {
      "comment" : "Summary: the session differed from its saved workout",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du hast dieses Workout heute geändert"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You feel rusty and have problems moving through your full range of motion? This plan focuses on improving flexibility and mobility through a variety of dynamic and static stretches." : {
      "comment" : "Flexibility infoText",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du fühlst dich eingerostet und hast Schwierigkeiten, dich frei zu bewegen? Dieser Plan zielt darauf ab, deine Flexibilität und Mobilität durch eine Mischung aus dynamischen und statischen Dehnübungen zu verbessern."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You finished every workout in this plan. Restart it to go through the workouts again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du hast alle Workouts in diesem Plan abgeschlossen. Starte ihn neu, um die Workouts noch einmal zu durchlaufen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You'll only hear from us when a goal is still open — and never once you've hit it. Automatic picks a time from when you usually train." : {
      "comment" : "Weekly goals: reminders footer",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wir melden uns nur, wenn ein Ziel noch offen ist — und nie mehr, sobald du es erreicht hast. Automatisch wählt eine Zeit danach, wann du normalerweise trainierst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're well recovered, so here's a full %d-exercise %@ session." : {
      "comment" : "Generator rationale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du bist gut erholt, hier eine volle %1$d-übungs %2$@ Session."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "You're well recovered, so here's a full %1$d-exercise %2$@ session."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You've been building volume lately — this should feel manageable." : {
      "comment" : "Difficulty rationale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du hast in letzter Zeit dein Volumen gesteigert – das sollte machbar sein."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You've been building volume lately — this should feel manageable."
          }
        }
      }
    },
